                    Regis Marie College
                </h2>

                <h3 style=''text-align:center;color:#1e3a8a;''>
                    Campus Event Management System
                </h3>

                <hr>

                <p>Hello,</p>

                <p>
                    We received a request to reset your password.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Click the button below to create a new password.
                </p>

                <div style=''text-align:center;margin:35px;''>

                    <a href=''http://localhost/campus_event_system/reset_password.php?token=e6e58ba55f7d5fc7fa2326f867a578955457f13bc11e62678c43eca9d2db0e49''
                    style=''background:#991b1b;
                    color:white;
                    padding:14px 28px;
                    text-decoration:none;
                    border-radius:8px;
                    font-weight:bold;
                    display:inline-block;''>

                    Reset Password

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    This link will expire in <strong>1 hour</strong>.
                </p>

                <p>
                    If you did not request a password reset,
                    you may safely ignore this email.
                </p>

                <br>

                <p>
                    Regards,<br>
                    <strong>Regis Marie College Event System</strong>
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>
        ', 'Sent', '2026-08-02 21:13:25.883712');
